---
title: "C13 — Ordering and no-op handling · Implemented"
---
flowchart TD
  Input[Start, end, before or after anchor] --> Check[Validate task, column, anchor and versions]
  Check --> Remove[Remove task from its current sequence]
  Remove --> Insert[Insert at requested destination position]
  Insert --> Compare{Result differs from canonical order?}
  Compare -->|No| Noop[Return without artificial revision or event]
  Compare -->|Yes| Reindex[Assign dense positions to affected columns]
  Reindex --> Changed[Find rows whose values actually changed]
  Changed --> Commit[Update changed versions and outbox atomically]
  Commit --> IDs[Return changedTaskIds for reconciliation]
